    "explanation": "Both of you: this ruling decides the SGD 12.87 charged on trip TRP-00805 (EV-FARE-00805).\n\nTHE DEVIATION IS ESTABLISHED. EV-GPS-00805 records 5.5 km driven against the booking estimate of 2.5 km on EV-TRIP-00805 — an excess of 3.0 km, or 120% of optimal. Both POL-RD-01 tests pass (above 20% and above 0.8 km), and the excess also clears the 50% materiality limb. The trace governs the distance, and it is clean for policy purposes: 90 fixes at a 10-second cadence, 100% coverage, no gaps (EV-GPS-00805), so POL-RD-07 does not impair it and POL-RD-10(3) is not engaged.\n\nTO THE DRIVER: your explanation that you were following the rider's chat request (EV-CHAT-00805, 'Please stop at Golden Mile Tower first.') does not excuse the route. POL-RD-04 requires the trace to show the vehicle passing within 200 m of the requested waypoint, and the platform's own match (derived.waypoint_approach) puts the nearest fix 1,592 m away — nearly eight times the radius. Under POL-RD-14 this is a failed corroboration, not a genuine contradiction, so no distance is excluded and the excess stands as measured. No traffic advisory is on file either: EV-ADVIS-00805-01 is MISSING, carries issue code MISSING_ARTIFACT and weight 0.0, and can carry no fact, so POL-RD-03 gives no closure exoneration.\n\nTO THE RIDER: your request to review the whole fare cannot succeed. The fare is METERED with quoted_fare_sgd null, so POL-RD-11 does not run and POL-RD-02 governs. Recomputed_fare = ((3.80 base + 0.75 x 2.5 km + 0.28 x 8.0 min) x 1.0 surge read from EV-FARE-00805.surge_multiplier) + 0.80 platform fee + 0 ERP + 0 surcharges + 0 waiting time - 0 promo = 8.715. Refund = charged_total 12.87 - 8.715 = 4.155, rounded up to SGD 4.20. That is 32.3% of the charge — above the SGD 0.50 de minimis, far below the 90% full-refund share, so this is a PARTIAL_REFUND.\n\nNO OTHER MONEY MOVES. There is no ERP and no airport surcharge on EV-FARE-00805, so POL-RD-09 adds no standalone correction and nothing is double-counted on top of the POL-RD-02 figure. The distance billed (5.5 km) matches the trace, so there is no unbilled-distance shortfall and no driver compensation under POL-RD-04. Because the deviation is material, the POL-RD-06 driver-profile check runs, but driver_profile.deviation_flags_90d is 0 against 300 completed trips, so no repeat pattern is established: no FULL_REFUND uplift and no driver-conduct referral.\n\nThe disputed amount is PARTIALLY REFUNDED — SGD 4.20 back to the rider. The monetary effect (SGD 4.20) is below the SGD 8.00 automatic-execution threshold (POL-GEN-05), so it executes on issue. Confidence 0.9."
  },
